Busque por modelos que podem lhe dar respostas mais interessantes. Veja,

A.Det=c(-0.595750,0.050250,0.270000,0.711500,1.608750,3.353500,4.937652,4.573750,4.955000) 
luz=c(0,25,50,75,100,500,1000,1500,2000)

